FTP: the FTP client, without FTP over SSL (no OpenSSL);
php82-ftp-openssl has it.

The module ftp of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/ftp.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/ftp.
